      "description": "Set up, manage, and control Tapo home security cameras, smart plugs, smart lighting, and more – all from the Tapo app. Tapo aims to help you live a smarter, easier, and more secure life.\n\n- Control from Afar\nQuickly and easily connect and control all your devices from a single tap, no matter where you are! Organize your devices across Homes and Rooms with ease. Group your devices for batch control. You can also share devices to your friends or family members to control together.\n\n- Know what’s going on\nGet the status of your devices in real time. Understand what’s going on at home at a glance, and get instant notifications.\nIntelligent features in the Tapo home security cameras let you tune into the action live, record important moments, talk to your pets, and scare away intruders.\n*Get up to 30 days of cloud video history and enjoy AI detections with Tapo Care (subscription service) for Tapo home security cameras.\n\n- Automate your home with Smart Actions\nMake your Tapo devices work around your daily routine. Have your lights gently wake you up in the morning or turn off all your home devices when you leave home. Custom Smart Actions give your home that level of intelligence in a snap.\n\n- Hands-free Voice Control\nUse your voice to control your Tapo devices via Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, Siri or your favorite smart assistant. Simple voice commands let you turn on/off devices, or adjust the brightness/temperature/color. You can even cast your security cameras to display on your TV – without opening the app.\n\nStay tuned for updates as we add new features and products to the Tapo family!\nFor more information about your Tapo, visit www.tapo.com\n\nTerms of Use\nhttps://www.tapo.com/app/privacy/#terms-of-use\nPrivacy Policy\nhttps://www.tapo.com/app/privacy/#privacy-policy",
